---
import release from '../data/release.json';
---
<section class="release-card" aria-label="Current editor download"><div><p class="eyebrow">Windows desktop editor</p><h2>Learning Site Editor <em>v{release.version}</em></h2><p>Write with confidence, preview locally, and publish from the same project.</p>{release.source === 'fallback' && <p class="notice">Live release details were unavailable during this build. The button opens the official latest release.</p>}</div><div class="release-actions"><a class="button" href={release.downloadUrl}>Download for Windows</a><a class="text-link" href={release.releaseUrl}>Read release notes ↗</a></div></section>
